# Mansion Calcinada 1F (C7, contract 53), 24 x 18, interior. The burnt manor: BIG light scorched boards (`burnt_<i%2><j%2>`), charred plaster walls on the back sides, cinder patches (the wild tiles), rubble and crates.
# THE STATUES: a solid NPC whose script toggles the story flag `mansion_sw` (860) for the WHOLE mansion; the boarded doors (NPC `bdoor`, `gate=yes`) are A doors (hide_flag = the flag: shut while it is clear) or B doors (show_flag: shut
# while it is set). 1F: the lobby (the way in (11..12,16), a burglar looking down column 11), the east room with the first statue and the first diary, the west room behind the A door (6,5) holds the stairs up, the south-east room (a diary),
# the south-west room (the freight lift from B1F arrives at (3,13)).
@map mansion_calcinada_1
@size 24 18
@interior yes
@area mansion_calcinada
@bg 0
@fill burnt_00
@flag mansion_sw 860      # the statues' switch: ONE flag for the whole mansion, every statue toggles it (set = "on"); the A doors are shut while it is clear, the B doors while it is set
@encounters grass rate=12
  cindermeer 36 40 25
  cindibex 36 40 20
  origamorph 36 40 15
  slickslime 36 39 15
  smogkeg 36 40 15
  tarbog 38 41 10
  foldling 36 40 10
@end
@spawn door 11 15 N
@spawn up 3 4 S
@spawn lift 3 13 S
@legend
  .  tile=air_0
  a  tile=none object=charwall
  b  tile=burnt_01
  c  tile=burnt_11
  d  tile=burnt_00
  e  tile=burnt_10
  f  tile=ember_10
  g  tile=ember_01
  h  tile=ember_00
  i  tile=ember_11
  j  tile=burnt_10 object=rubble_c7
  k  tile=burnt_00 object=rubble_c7
  l  tile=mat
  m  tile=burnt_11 door=stairs
  n  tile=burnt_11 object=bookshelf interact=look script=diary1
  o  tile=burnt_11 face=S id=s1 npc=statue_off script=statue
  p  tile=burnt_01 face=S gate=yes hide_flag=mansion_sw id=dw npc=bdoor text=mansion.door
  q  tile=burnt_10 after=tr.ladron_m1a.after face=SW id=t1 npc=ladron_s range=4 text=tr.ladron_m1a.pre trainer=ladron_m1a
  r  tile=burnt_00 after=tr.cientifico_m1b.after face=NW id=t2 npc=cientifico_s range=3 text=tr.cientifico_m1b.pre trainer=cientifico_m1b
  s  tile=burnt_11 object=bookshelf interact=look script=diary2
  t  tile=burnt_01 object=rubble_c7
  u  tile=burnt_10 object=crate_plain
  v  tile=burnt_11 item=prime_salve
  w  tile=burnt_11 object=crate_plain
  x  tile=burnt_11 item=rich_salve
  H  tile=burnt_11 hidden=panacea   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ........................
  ........................
  ..aaaa..aaaaaaaa..aaaa..
  .abmbc.abcbcbcbc.abnbo..
  .adedeaadjdedekeaadede..
  .abcbcpcbcbcbcbcbcbcbH..
  .adede.adedqdede.adede..
  .abcbc.abcbcbcbc.abcbc..
  .adede.adfhfdede.adere..
  .......abigibcbc........
  ..aaaa.adfhfdede..aaaa..
  .abcbc.abcbcgigc.absbc..
  .adekeaadedehfheaadede..
  .abcbcbcbcbcgigcbcbctc..
  .adede.adudededj.adede..
  .abvbw.abcbcbcbc.abcbx..
  ..........all...........
  ........................
@warp l -> isla_ceniza_sur spawn=mansion_door
@warp m -> mansion_calcinada_2 spawn=down
# A statue switch: every one of them toggles the SAME flag (mansion_sw): the A doors (boarded while it is clear) open, the B doors (boarded while it is set) shut, or the other way round.
@script statue npc
    sfx hit
    jf mansion_sw off
    setf mansion_sw
    say mansion.sw.on
    end
  off:
    clrf mansion_sw
    say mansion.sw.off
@end
@script diary1 interact
    say mansion.d1
@end
@script diary2 interact
    say mansion.d2
@end
